  "summary": "Round 2 on PR 19932. Old head fc8eda2d62, new head 4a724cfbf3; both commits were pushed with one fast-forward push, with no amend, rebase or force. (1) ea78da8908 merges main at 2c1011b01b with a merge commit. The merge was clean, and no os-regen deferral was recorded. I re-measured the pin file two ways. `git log fdeeea0cc9..2c1011b01b -- packages/spec/src/type-alias-convention.pin.test.ts` is empty. The control leg holds: the same log without the range lists d0f1845657, 5ce3705052 and 1b82c519df; is-ancestor fdeeea0cc9 of main exits 0; and the repo is not shallow. The file blob is 5620656d04 on both fdeeea0cc9 and 2c1011b01b. So the merge leaves the pin file byte-identical to fc8eda2d62 (blob 8ae4405bd5), and the re-key was not re-run. readIsomorphicPins reads 789 on main and 789 on the merged head, with a set difference of 0 both ways. The control fires: dropping one pin line reads 788, difference 1. The branch delta against main is exactly two files: the pin file (+969/-989, unchanged from round 1) and duration.test.ts (+1/-1). (2) 4a724cfbf3 changes comment text only. packages/spec/src/shared/duration.test.ts:11 now cites `Iso_shared_epoch__EpochMs` instead of `Iso868`. I derived the name from the head file: line 1169 is the only pin on M185.EpochMs, and M185 is ./shared/epoch.zod.js. The control holds: base fdeeea0cc9 line 1028 is `export type Iso868` on M185.EpochMs. (3) I ran `git grep -n -E 'Iso[0-9]+'` over packages/spec/src, excluding the pin file (exit 0). It finds 4 hits. The control on fc8eda2d62 finds 5, the fifth being the duration.test.ts line. The 4 hits are ui/component.zod.ts:2052 (Iso818, ElementNumberPropsSchema), :2523 (Iso819, ElementRecordPickerPropsSchema) and :2929 (Iso839, ObjectGridPropsSchema), plus ui/i18n.zod.ts:198 (Iso759, InlineLocaleMapSchema). Each hit says in its own words that the line was deleted. Each named schema has 0 pins at head, 0 at base fdeeea0cc9 and 0 at main; the EpochMs control reads 1. The reviewer's