  "tests": "Everything below was run on HEAD 4a724cfbf3 (`git rev-parse --short HEAD`), with a clean tree, and every exit code was captured before any pipe. (1) `pnpm --filter @objectstack/spec check:test-typecheck` under os-verify-lock: VERDICT command-exit 0, with the line \"check:test-typecheck: OK — @objectstack/spec's test layer compiles under packages/spec/tsconfig.test.json; 53 file(s) / 255 error(s) / 142 pinned signature(s) held\". (2) `node scripts/check-spec-parsed-alias.mjs`: exit 0, \"ADR-0122 type-alias convention: 1459 bare z.input aliases, 789 pinned isomorphic, 670 paired with an XParsed. OK\". With --self-test: exit 0, \"18 assertions passed\". (3) Spec tests covering both touched files: `pnpm --filter @objectstack/spec exec vitest run --project local --maxWorkers=2 --reporter=verbose src/type-alias-convention.pin.test.ts src/shared/duration.test.ts`. VERDICT command-exit 0, \"Test Files 2 passed (2) · Tests 14 passed (14)\", and the verbose output names both files. The whole spec local project (`vitest run --project local --maxWorkers=2`): VERDICT command-exit 0, \"Test Files 530 passed (530) · Tests 15617 passed | 1 todo (15618)\". (4) `pnpm --filter @objectstack/spec run typecheck` (tsc --noEmit, then scripts, then the test layer): VERDICT command-exit 0. (5) Gates were derived from this worktree: `node scripts/pm/dispatch-gates.mjs --repo objectstack-ai/objectstack --commands` gave 77 commands, change set 2 paths vs merge base 2c1011b01, tree 4a724cfbf3. I ran all 77, logged each run, and captured each exit code. Four gates first exited 3 (PREREQUISITE NOT MET), which counts as NOT MEASURED, not as a pass: check:doc-formula-expressions, check:lean-entry-closure, check:dual-build-cjs-loads and check:type-check-debt. I ran the builds each one names under os-verify-lock (formula+lint, objectql, then `turbo run build --filter=./packages/* --filter=./packages/*/*`: 72/72 tasks, VERDICT 0) and re-ran them. After those builds, all four exit 0: \"check