  "pr_body_patch": {
    "note": "Six edits to the stored PR 19932 body. Every other byte stays, including line 1 `Fixes #19665`, line 2 `Clause-②: no`, the rekey.mjs block and the session-URL footer. The whole result is at /tmp/claude-0/-home-user/81e4e554-e06d-5912-8719-8a43a687429a/scratchpad/issue-19665-r2/pr_body_r2.md (15498 chars, sha256 613a24311046a8982c1d945827787b23733cb02e399c454159b9ae3cc75eb820, 0 less-than chars, 0 double-brace openers). The only closing keyword in it is `Fixes #19665` on line 1.",
    "edits": [
      {
        "replace": "There are two commits:",
