      {
        "after_line": "   - The count history gets a `789 -> 789` entry.",
        "insert": "3. `ea78da8908`: a merge of `main` at `2c1011b01b`, to re-measure this head on current `main`. `main` has not touched the pin file since the merge base: its blob is `5620656d04` on both `fdeeea0cc9` and `2c1011b01b`. So the merge leaves the file exactly as `fc8eda2d62` had it, and the re-key was not re-run.\n4. `4a724cfbf3`: `packages/spec/src/shared/duration.test.ts:11` cited the `EpochMs` pin as `Iso868`. It now cites `Iso_shared_epoch__EpochMs`. This commit changes comment text only.\n\nThe diff against `main` is two files: the pin file, and that one comment line in `duration.test.ts`.\n"
